  "slug": "the-last-caesar-salad-recipe-youll-ever-need",
  "name": "The Last Caesar Salad Recipe You'll Ever Need",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This is a classic creamy Caesar salad dressing that's perfect for a salad or for dipping vegetables. To serve, toss with chopped romaine in a salad bowl and shave Parmesan cheese on top of salad; season with salt, black pepper, and a squeeze of fresh lemon juice.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine anchovy fillets with garlic in a food processor and pulse several times to form a paste. Process mayonnaise, Parmesan cheese, half-and-half, lemon juice, Dijon mustard, and Worcestershire sauce with anchovy mixture until dressing is creamy. Refrigerate for 1 hour or more before serving."
    }
  ],
